--   * the 18 doors are forced to type=0 (Door); Data0-6 (startOpen/lockId/autoCloseTime/
--     noDamageImmune/openTextID/closeTextID/ignoredByPathing) are taken from source as-is.
--   * the 2 known chests (357751, 357752) are forced to type=3 (Chest) with Data0=0 (no lock;
--     source's raw Data0=1634 was a lockId with zero matching rows in this fork's lock_dbc --
--     fixed post-generation to match this fork's own established chest convention, verified
--     against the existing heirloom-cache chests 1991001-1991003 which all use Data0=0) and
--     Data1 (lootId) forced to the GO's own entry, matching the entry=lootid linkage convention
--     used for creature_template.lootid -- actual gameobject_loot_template content is a separate
--     companion pass, this only wires the numeric linkage.
--   * everything else keeps the source type/Data0-23 verbatim.
-- AIName/ScriptName = '' for every row (no GO scripting in this pass).
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
